                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b01567d9-6fac-462a-9bd5-3fde99d2d764",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "тихо",
                        "target_lang_word": "noiselessly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "noiselessly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                        "entry_id": "0da88b86-e408-316f-a54a-41f906f08760",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a quiet manner, without any noise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4840c4b9-cb46-49b2-95c4-46efbfa8a8b3",
                                                "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                                "text": "Noiselessly she laid the clematis and wattle on her bed, then stood near the covered face, and, looking down at her untied bootlaces, sighed an impatient sigh always well known and understood by this now unresponsive father."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50472295-0828-4058-9ad9-1ff7bfb21f9d",
                                                "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                                "text": "Not thirty paces behind the two she crouched--Sabor, the huge lioness--lashing her tail. Cautiously she moved a great padded paw forward, noiselessly placing it before she lifted the next. Thus she advanced; her belly low, almost touching the surface of the ground--a great cat preparing to spring upon its prey."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcea5b79-89d8-41d4-94d8-71fff74dbbb5",
                                                "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                                "text": "I now, O friend, whom noiselessly the snows / Settle around, and whose small chamber grows / Dusk as the sloping window takes its load:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "017af60b-60c8-4161-a301-beae3a6c21de",
                                                "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                                "text": "The Bat—they called him the Bat. Like a bat he chose the night hours for his work of rapine; like a bat he struck and vanished, pouncingly, noiselessly; like a bat he never showed himself to the face of the day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c591220d-de6a-4c53-a4f9-843cdb28cbab",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "тихо",
                        "target_lang_word": "quietly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quietly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54591f42-6dcf-3765-ae69-a703fa8cbaf8",
                                        "entry_id": "cb74771d-09fc-385a-8146-2745d8ff403a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a quiet manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4326ee50-f560-403b-a186-fd887ddddd83",
                                                "sense_id": "54591f42-6dcf-3765-ae69-a703fa8cbaf8",
                                                "text": "When Timothy and Julia hurried up the staircase to the bedroom floor, where a considerable commotion was taking place, Tim took Barry Leach with him.[…]. The captive made no resistance and came not only quietly but in a series of eager little rushes like a timid dog on a choke chain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "be27a7a2-5b66-4b5e-b179-5dba651b3b99",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "тихо",
                        "target_lang_word": "silently",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73db7210-4dfc-33b7-9d1d-a3d4c6c99ec3",
                                        "entry_id": "d3aaf0d9-85cb-3950-96cc-2596731d1cf1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a silent manner; making no noise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dd1de5e-2418-443b-bc85-8832823a89fa",
                                                "sense_id": "73db7210-4dfc-33b7-9d1d-a3d4c6c99ec3",
                                                "text": "It often happens that the most important results in the natural world are brought about by causes which operate silently, if not imperceptibly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db4e2e38-6298-4fab-afb0-ee64d924855e",
                                                "sense_id": "73db7210-4dfc-33b7-9d1d-a3d4c6c99ec3",
                                                "text": "Frederick, I presume, at this late hour of four, may be snatching a morsel of dinner; his orderlies are silently speeding, plans taken, orders given: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0c4f1bd-e3dd-3db0-ac81-e039fd2f4797",
                                        "entry_id": "d3aaf0d9-85cb-3950-96cc-2596731d1cf1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of an edit or change to a text, without explicit acknowledgment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f21bbce9-e5e9-401a-9362-d9bccc78bf57",
                                                "sense_id": "c0c4f1bd-e3dd-3db0-ac81-e039fd2f4797",
                                                "text": "There never was an English-language text, either in 1561 or 1859. Yule and Burnell have silently provided a translation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "882176d8-c151-4e21-b5c8-108f00f1bf98",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "тихо",
                        "target_lang_word": "calmement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "calmement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "382729b6-dc9c-3e33-8e59-64a045bcfd12",
                                        "entry_id": "41d6c427-df3f-3a76-9553-8e1117d198bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière calme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "054272e8-13e2-41e3-88f4-7fc317b738ad",
                                                "sense_id": "382729b6-dc9c-3e33-8e59-64a045bcfd12",
                                                "text": "Personne, en considérant les choses calmement et sans passion, ne dira qu’il a le droit […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7377b4a8-7540-4661-ab2f-551e8aca3cec",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "тихо",
                        "target_lang_word": "silencieusement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silencieusement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                        "entry_id": "452d291e-f59a-32f2-b385-34bf79b782f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière silencieuse; en silence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3fd4578-977a-4ede-a28c-6da71ac36409",
                                                "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                                "text": "Afin que, retraçant aux jeunes gens le souvenir des hommes illustres, ils invitassent silencieusement à les imiter,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3a6852b-026e-4554-9b7b-fe2a15eca486",
                                                "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                                "text": "Dans ces murailles, les murmures, les lamentations, les appels à la justice et les cris de la souffrance meurent tous silencieusement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a054a63-ecd4-4b52-a608-8d6eb528a387",
                                                "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                                "text": "Les uns allaient rendre leurs armes ; d'autres, qui les avaient abandonnées déjà, marchaient silencieusement, les mains ballantes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13b75681-d0e5-4694-9e1e-8f59cfcec567",
                                                "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                                "text": "Le Père Directeur, qui était venu me rejoindre dans mon bureau de l’hôpital , ne me répondit rien et continua à tirer silencieusement sur son long fume-cigare."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "997b2293-8e83-34a8-aa6b-1aaf31d8991a",
                                        "entry_id": "452d291e-f59a-32f2-b385-34bf79b782f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sans faire parler de soi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "956d9b5a-c17c-429a-9918-18f7fcd0b34f",
                                                "sense_id": "997b2293-8e83-34a8-aa6b-1aaf31d8991a",
                                                "text": "Naguère l'artiste rebuté par la stupidité de la foule se repliait dans sa coquille, œuvrait silencieusement, en garde contre le pompiérisme odieux de son époque, attendant son heure qui sonnait toujours trop tard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7f2b2faf-226a-4ec9-8516-8e33b8204d90",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "тайком",
                        "target_lang_word": "secretly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "secretly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa212b37-1bd2-3683-ac35-9914de12ec2b",
                                        "entry_id": "f750af24-1b9f-391b-bacc-1a1b741fa738",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In secret, covertly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "955eb3c7-3628-4239-b56d-95885089fe35",
                                                "sense_id": "fa212b37-1bd2-3683-ac35-9914de12ec2b",
                                                "text": "Mary cheated secretly in the test, and never got caught."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0700bdb5-d9fa-46ff-b7bd-e8349ca073f2",
                                                "sense_id": "fa212b37-1bd2-3683-ac35-9914de12ec2b",
                                                "text": "Sometimes her prose hyperventilates (\"Once, years ago, his and N.'s love for each other had glowed like phosphorescent fire on the surfaces of their bodies\"), and she has a weakness for epiphanies (\"There was a man, no longer young, though not yet old, who, traveling alone in northern Europe, began to feel that his soul was being drained slowly, almost secretly from him, drop by drop\")."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea01dc66-3367-4e8a-b65f-5a0c659074e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "тайком",
                        "target_lang_word": "by stealth",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "308c74c2-34ea-4ead-82a9-f6216a1339eb",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "тайком",
                        "target_lang_word": "discrètement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "discrètement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3d90b2a-dfed-37e3-b360-d892dcd54a7a",
                                        "entry_id": "b3fbd14b-9781-3b97-b122-fee050016840",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Avec retenue ; avec réserve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5532403f-3889-4ac3-8bc1-53349b6e72fb",
                                                "sense_id": "e3d90b2a-dfed-37e3-b360-d892dcd54a7a",
                                                "text": "Elle fixa sur ses cheveux relevés un de ces délicieux chapeaux qu'on ne trouve qu'à Paris, sorte de tambourin de paille noir discrètement orné de fleurettes roses et d'une voilette."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76ed16df-bb9d-4ae6-aa8d-63a4e23f2b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "e3d90b2a-dfed-37e3-b360-d892dcd54a7a",
                                                "text": "Pour le prouver, et alors que les reptiles s’accouplent généralement discrètement, Megan Folwell table sur l’étude de leurs circuits neuronaux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a820a3e4-fe47-4039-912b-5bd7fc83dbcd",
                                                "sense_id": "e3d90b2a-dfed-37e3-b360-d892dcd54a7a",
                                                "text": "Je continuerais ici, monseigneur, bien volontiers ce discours ; mais je crains de n'user pas assez discrètement de la liberté que l’on m’a donnée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc796c29-7a97-3201-a7b4-36fc864df7f7",
                                        "entry_id": "b3fbd14b-9781-3b97-b122-fee050016840",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sans dire ce qui doit être tu."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7005c691-c0de-4c99-867c-9ee7837a7357",
                                                "sense_id": "dc796c29-7a97-3201-a7b4-36fc864df7f7",
                                                "text": "Au bled, le père s'était remarié en scred, discrètement, avec une jeunette, sans dire qu'il avait un fils de cinq ans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87755400-a82e-44f5-8418-914e15e2d614",
                                                "sense_id": "dc796c29-7a97-3201-a7b4-36fc864df7f7",
                                                "text": "Vous affûtez vos armes discrètement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbf23be4-d874-48ee-bc7f-7005cbb3f917",
                                                "sense_id": "dc796c29-7a97-3201-a7b4-36fc864df7f7",
                                                "text": "Ce soir les hommes ont allumé un brasier et nous avons dîné de succulentes grillades, merguez et côtes d'agneau. Nous avons même bu un verre de boulaouane, mais discrètement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc86e542-3410-3e46-86e3-688688109a0c",
                                        "entry_id": "b3fbd14b-9781-3b97-b122-fee050016840",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "De façon discontinue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ef79fa4-26b8-4325-b1fa-ddfa389e2590",
                                                "sense_id": "cc86e542-3410-3e46-86e3-688688109a0c",
                                                "text": "La taille d'une population d'insectes varie discrètement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "252cf307-4ddd-415c-ae70-5abddfbf916d",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "медленно",
                        "target_lang_word": "slowly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "slowly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db85281f-919c-3f62-a1b9-2d48ce245f06",
                                        "entry_id": "78fe7996-2beb-3c73-b0b0-905400714f84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At a slow pace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e606f1e1-3631-4dd6-bda6-2185065cc878",
                                                "sense_id": "db85281f-919c-3f62-a1b9-2d48ce245f06",
                                                "text": "Then everybody once more knelt, and soon the blessing was pronounced. The choir and the clergy trooped out slowly, […], down the nave to the western door. […] At a seemingly immense distance the surpliced group stopped to say the last prayer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0760dda-3f27-4a04-bc8d-6f1f7d3aba92",
                                                "sense_id": "db85281f-919c-3f62-a1b9-2d48ce245f06",
                                                "text": "When bond yields rise slowly over time, it’s not a problem for pensions deploying LDI strategies, and actually helps their finances."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a2d1b1d-bffd-475d-b028-9a30027580d9",
                        "source_entry_id": "34f1a56f-dbb5-3f5a-8c42-10af418f672b",
                        "source_sense_description": "медленно",
                        "target_lang_word": "tranquillement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tranquillement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de2633a2-0d7e-3d04-acbb-77c9a4459c32",
                                        "entry_id": "96d18160-d28a-3321-b61c-ea4d179c5d20",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière tranquille ; avec tranquillité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79689f8d-350a-49a0-bbf8-bf8bb1f5ce6b",
                                                "sense_id": "de2633a2-0d7e-3d04-acbb-77c9a4459c32",
                                                "text": "Le uhlan mettait pied à terre, ouvrait tranquillement une carte ou un calepin, prenait des notes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e64e10c-4c66-4f99-83a0-eb6e7ac0a587",
                                                "sense_id": "de2633a2-0d7e-3d04-acbb-77c9a4459c32",
                                                "text": "Le départ du défenseur devrait au moins permettre à John Textor de passer plus tranquillement son grand oral devant la DNCG, ce mercredi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dca1ada4-7d30-459a-9e89-f8970b055786",
                                                "sense_id": "de2633a2-0d7e-3d04-acbb-77c9a4459c32",
                                                "text": "Mais, saperlotte ! tâchons donc que tout ça se passe tranquillement; ça vaudrait beaucoup mieux. Puisque nous avons le suffrage universel, il n’y a plus besoin de coups de fusil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b67a8ead-6809-488d-b89d-ed78bc6c2d6e",
                                                "sense_id": "de2633a2-0d7e-3d04-acbb-77c9a4459c32",
                                                "text": "Et Charles IX se remit à siffler tranquillement et plus juste que jamais son air favori."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19a396ed-e9ab-4fd2-9e24-5d1ffae916eb",
                                                "sense_id": "de2633a2-0d7e-3d04-acbb-77c9a4459c32",
                                                "text": "Préviens ta femme de ton arrivée. Ça me laissera le temps de passer tranquillement mon froc et de ne pas enfiler, dans la précipitation, mon slip à l'envers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52cd3a1b-af4b-4f65-bdd7-ac3fbcd35916",
                                                "sense_id": "de2633a2-0d7e-3d04-acbb-77c9a4459c32",
                                                "text": "Si jamais le prince de Condé parut un homme extraordinaire, s’il parut voir tranquillement toutes choses, c’est dans ces rapides moments d’où dépendent les victoires,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
